<p>Attack your foes in a frontal arc with a roundhouse kick, which deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>physical power 100">90, 121, 145, 165, 183</acronym> physical damage and knocks your foes back 4 grids. This will break any grapples you're maintaining</p><p>The damage improves with your Physical Power.</p>